        "explanation": "The doctor gave a mostly executable plan with red flags and inpatient-team questions.",
        "quote": "接下来的关键就是跟着团队走24~48小时，同时盯住红旗信号"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00087",
        "explanation": "The last caregiver message still asked for confirmation of thresholds, but no further doctor repair occurred.",
        "quote": "这个“93”和“95”我怕记反了"
      },
