        "event_id": "lite_evt_00040",
        "explanation": "The doctor had visible notice that outside imaging was not synced, but closure did not tell the caregiver to bring/show it.",
        "quote": "外院胸片原始资料未直接同步；"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The plan was largely executable for inpatient escalation and medication non-adjustment, but closure was premature because a caregiver clarification was left unanswered and an authored material-handoff requirement for outside imaging was not completed.",
